{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123682","id":4594728466,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEd3-Eg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123682.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123682","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123682/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123682/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123682/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/464ac449d9d8533b2da6e9961faa17a6bcba58b0","number":123682,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix TileSet loading slowdown from repeated full sorts of ID lists","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123486\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\nThe ID/coordinate lists in TileSet need to stay sorted, but the previous approach appended to the end and re-sorted the entire list on every insertion.\r\nFor large tilesets this adds up fast.\r\nNoticing that we already have `Vector<T>::ordered_insert`, we can simply adopt it to solve this problem, producing the same result as the original code while avoiding repeated full re-sorts.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e2b42469291c6889f93ad83debb5d24f607d26e3/core/templates/vector.h#L200-L203\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e2b42469291c6889f93ad83debb5d24f607d26e3/modules/tilemap/tile_set.cpp#L5008-L5017\r\n\r\nPerformance test (using the script from the issue):\r\n```powershell\r\nscons platform=windows target=editor dev_build=yes arch=x86_64\r\n```\r\n```powershell\r\n#before\r\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.custom_build.e2b424692 (2026-09-21 15:02:04 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\n\r\n  1000 tiles:    0.049 s\r\n  2000 tiles:    0.201 s\r\n  4000 tiles:    0.905 s\r\n  8000 tiles:    3.805 s\r\n 16000 tiles:   16.092 s\r\n 32000 tiles:   75.122 s\r\n#after\r\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.custom_build.a0d0d38b8 (2026-09-21 17:48:25 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\n\r\n  1000 tiles:    0.006 s\r\n  2000 tiles:    0.011 s\r\n  4000 tiles:    0.023 s\r\n  8000 tiles:    0.048 s\r\n 16000 tiles:    0.102 s\r\n 32000 tiles:    0.226 s\r\n ```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_ur